<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts natural gas firms.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts natural gas firms.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman said it cut ratings of Consolidated Natural Gas Co, Coastal Corp and PanEnergy Corp.</p>
<p>-- Consolidated Natural Gas was cut to a market perform from an outperform. Its shares fell 1-1/8 to 58-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Coastal Corp was cut to perform from recommended. Shares rose 1/8 to 48-3/4 and touched a new intraday high of 49-3/4.</p>
<p>-- PanEnergy was cut to perform from recommended. Shares rose 1/8 to 43-7/8.</p>
</text>
